'''Michael G. Reed''' (January 6, 1975 – January 31, 2014) was an American professional [[American football|football]] [[Fullback (American football)|fullback]] who played one season with the [[Philadelphia Eagles]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] at the [[University of Washington]].
